; Storage in a 130XE's extended memory, for an `atari/130xe.ngp` program: the
; Banks of the unit set `extension`, read through the Window `ext`, and the
; decoders the tool ships. A Project includes this beside the machine. The
; driver is the machine's, since it shows a Pane's Bank whether or not there is
; storage.
storage { units extension }

; Every Transition calls the decoders, so they are resident; a decoder nothing
; uses is dropped.
modules { "stream/zx0.asm" }
resident { zx0 }
